error[SC0411]: `t` points at nothing, since it was read out of memory nothing wrote
    ╭─[ a_pointer_read_out_of_fresh_memory_is_reported_where_a_null_test_passes.c:12:9 ]
    │
 12 │         *t = 1;
    │         ───┬──  
